{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Recruit, build your party, and fight the horde \u2014 every run reshapes how the world remembers your cursed heroes.</strong>&quot; <br><i>Cursed Heroes</i> is a roguelike action RPG with J-RPG mechanics, where each run pushes time forward by 50 years. Your heroes are reborn into a changing world\u2014remembered as saviors, feared as curses, or forgotten entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915880/extras/be6ec4bb0cbfd7e8ecc5034c74c49107.poster.avif?t=1759916552\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915880/extras/be6ec4bb0cbfd7e8ecc5034c74c49107.webm?t=1759916552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit by day, endure by night</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, <strong>seek out</strong> villages to recruit new companions and expand your <strong>party</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By night, <strong>face</strong> relentless demon hordes and fight to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your party, define your playstyle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>nine cursed heroes</strong>, each with unique class trees and synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine</strong> their abilities to create powerful builds\u2014from unbreakable frontlines to devastating spellcasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave a legacy beyond your control</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run advances the world by half a century.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villages <strong>change</strong>, myths distort, and your <strong>reputation</strong> decides how future generations receive you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be hailed as a <strong>legendary savior</strong>\u2026 or rejected as a <strong>cursed threat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world that remembers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victories and failures shape the stories passed down across eras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new cycle is more than a fresh run\u2014it\u2019s the next chapter in the evolving history of your heroes.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915880?t=1759916552","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915880/dac2d7e0499c1fa9df77d9be66c18624a322866b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759916552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915880/e3c0215b6b54fd9f53a7706996a33591b844284b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759916552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915880/e3c0215b6b54fd9f53a7706996a33591b844284b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759916552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Recruit, build your party, and fight the horde \u2014 every run reshapes how the world remembers your cursed heroes.</strong>&quot; <br><i>Cursed Heroes</i> is a roguelike action RPG with J-RPG mechanics, where each run pushes time forward by 50 years. Your heroes are reborn into a changing world\u2014remembered as saviors, feared as curses, or forgotten entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_p